  "system": {
    "identifier": "catnap",
    "description": "<p>You make a calming gesture, and up to three willing creatures of your choice that you can see within range fall unconscious for the Genjutsu’s duration. You do not need to spend chakra to maintain concentration on this jutsu. The Genjutsu ends on a target early if it takes damage or someone uses an action to shake or slap it awake. If a target remains unconscious for the full duration, that target gains the benefit of a short rest, and it can’t be affected by this Genjutsu again until it finishes a long rest.</p>",
